---
// Founder facts sourced from about.html (already live on techmedng.com) —
// kept consistent with the established public bio rather than restated
// from scratch.
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="photo-wrap">
      <img src="/images/201319.jpg" alt="Wisdom Johnson, founder of TECHMED" />
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p class="label">A Note From the Founder</p>
      <h2>Wisdom Johnson — Tutor TechMed</h2>
      <p>
        Wisdom Johnson is a medical student at the University of Uyo and the
        founder of TECHMED. Before gaining admission, he lived the exact pain
        many Nigerian students face today — after secondary school in 2021, he
        wrote UTME in 2022 hoping to study Medicine &amp; Surgery, and was not
        admitted. He spent nearly three years at home facing that
        disappointment.
      </p>
      <p>
        Instead of giving up, he studied the admission process deeply. On his
        second attempt, he scored 331 in UTME and 91% in Chemistry, and
        secured admission to study Medicine &amp; Surgery in 2024.
      </p>
      <p class="quote">
        "Most students don't fail because they lack intelligence. They fail
        because they lack strategy, systems and proper guidance."
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-24) var(--space-6);
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .photo-wrap img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 4px solid var(--surface-raised);
  }

  .label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .photo-wrap img {
      width: 160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .quote {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
